Azael Avalos wrote:
> Those are great news to hear, but I have a question.
> Is the new /dev/toshiba interface going to have support for HCI only
> or also for SCI?

Yes, the /dev/toshiba provided by toshiba_acpi will support HCI and
SCI-- it's exactly the same as the toshiba driver.  If you want to try
it, the patch has been available for some time at
<http://memebeam.org/toys/ExperimentalToshibaAcpiDriver>.

